{"title":"[精彩回顾]杨盛开副总经理的主题演讲","date":"2017-06-22","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:28.0pt;\r\nmso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体\">[</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体\">精彩回顾<span lang=\"EN-US\">]</span>杨盛开副总经理的主题演讲<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:30.1pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">在这次研讨会上，四位企业负责人从不同的专业理念上，介绍其不同的研究、做法和经验，探索不同专业的项目管理发展之路，为项目管理的发展提供方向和指引。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">下面，让我们一起回顾广东汇熙建设有限公司杨盛开副总经理的精彩演讲。</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;text-indent:32.15pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/IMG_5807_%EF%BC%91.jpg\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 28pt; float: left;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;text-indent:32.15pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;text-indent:32.15pt;\r\nmso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体\">项目管理之安全管理探讨</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 28.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\">探讨了多变形势下安全管理的趋势及重要性；安全管理的重要性体现在哪里；安全管理的制度化与流程化的重要性与特点；现场安全文明施工的着重点。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/IMG_5818_%EF%BC%91.jpg\" style=\"float: left;\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:28.0pt;mso-line-height-rule:exactly\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong style=\"line-height: 27.75pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">项目管理之安全管理探讨</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<strong style=\"line-height: 27.75pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201706/1.png\" style=\"width: 1269px; height: 949px; float: left;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gp